    "title": "Paly flag football falls short against Milpitas 35-0 loss - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Maia Fisch ,\n2 days ago The Palo Alto girls flag football team lost to Milpitas 35-0 on Monday evening despite several strong plays on both offense and defense. Paly started the first quarter strong, gaining yards on offense and keeping Milpitas from scoring early on. However, Milpitas scored a touchdown later in the quarter and continued to gain momentum, bringing the score to 21-0 by halftime. Read full article",
